  "reflectionText": "Nebuchadnezzar boasted on the roof, was driven out into the field for seven seasons with hair like eagles' feathers, and at the end of the seventh lifted up his eyes to the sky. What is it to come back into the palace from seven seasons in the field, with the field still clinging to your hair and the boast you once made no longer in your bones?",
